'' '-c' OVER SEVERAL SOURCES: each its own object, as fbc does -- the '-o' that follows a
'' source names that source's object, and the others take their stem. All of them went
'' to the one '-o', so only the last source's symbols survived (audit F-47).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c -m multi-c-b tests/driver/src/multi-c-a.bas -o tests/driver/multica.o tests/driver/src/multi-c-b.bas -o tests/driver/multicb.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/multica.o
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/multicb.o
